{"header":{"type":"esummary","version":"0.3"},"result":{"uids":["200051871"],"200051871":{"uid":"200051871","accession":"GSE51871","gds":"","title":"Androgen and Glucocorticoid stimulation of LREX' cells in vitro","summary":"The treatment of advanced prostate cancer has been transformed by novel antiandrogen therapies such as enzalutamide.  Using the LnCaP/AR xenograft model, we identified induction of glucocorticoid receptor (GR) expression as a common feature of drug resistant tumors.  From a resistant xenograft tumor, we derived a GR expressing resistant subline called LREX.  In this model, activation of GR and AR activate a similar but distinguishable set of target genes.","gpl":"10558","gse":"51871","taxon":"Homo sapiens","entrytype":"GSE","gdstype":"Expression profiling by array","ptechtype":"","valtype":"","ssinfo":"","subsetinfo":"","pdat":"2013/12/27","suppfile":"TXT","samples":[{"accession":"GSM1254342","title":"Enzalutamide  + Dex 10nM (ECS195_29)"},{"accession":"GSM1254336","title":"Vehicle (DMSO) (ECS195_21)"},{"accession":"GSM1254339","title":"Dex 100 nM (ECS195_25)"},{"accession":"GSM1254333","title":"Enzalutamide  + DHT 1nM (ECS195_17)"},{"accession":"GSM1254327","title":"Enzalutamide  + Dex 100nM (ECS195_10)"},{"accession":"GSM1254330","title":"Dex 10 nM (ECS195_14)"},{"accession":"GSM1254334","title":"Enzalutamide  + Dex 10nM (ECS195_19)"},{"accession":"GSM1254331","title":"Dex 100 nM (ECS195_15)"},{"accession":"GSM1254325","title":"Enzalutamide  + DHT 1nM (ECS195_7)"},{"accession":"GSM1254328","title":"Vehicle (DMSO) (ECS195_11)"},{"accession":"GSM1254322","title":"Dex 10 nM (ECS195_4)"},{"accession":"GSM1254326","title":"Enzalutamide  + Dex 10nM (ECS195_9)"},{"accession":"GSM1254329","title":"DHT 1nM (ECS195_12)"},{"accession":"GSM1254343","title":"Enzalutamide  + Dex 100nM (ECS195_30)"},{"accession":"GSM1254337","title":"DHT 1nM (ECS195_22)"},{"accession":"GSM1254323","title":"Dex 100 nM (ECS195_5)"},{"accession":"GSM1254340","title":"Enzalutami